    <detaileddescription>
<para>ThemisDB | File: <ref refid="index__error__codes_8h" kindref="compound">index_error_codes.h</ref> | Version: 1.0.0 Maturity: FROZEN — Q3 2026 gate delivery Author: Copilot | Date: 2026-08-09</para>
<para>This header defines the canonical error taxonomy for the Index module. All index components (AnnFrontdoor, TieredIndexManager, ShardedIndexProxy, rebuild pipeline) MUST use these codes when returning structured errors.</para>
